{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0245_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "d6f3d3feb4871c3c02b1294c73d47428e3eaa9682a8397dbd6ec6b7b338d91d0", "ja": "終わりのない旅", "zh": "无休止的旅程", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0245_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "e4eee2bf14b1bd1221cc69612cf7f026d70df2d35da6fedd419ccd53ffe63714", "ja": "台本を読み進めていくうち、今回もまた\nハッピーエンドにならないと悟った恵美は\nプロデューサーに猛抗議。アレクサンドラの\n境遇に千鶴も落ち込み気味。そこで莉緒は、\n皆で幸せな番外編を考えようと提案する。", "zh": "读着剧本，惠美察觉到这次又不会是\n大团圆结局，于是向制作人提出了强烈抗议。\n千鹤也因为亚历珊德拉的境遇而有些消沉。\n这时莉绪提议，不如大家一起来想个幸福的番外篇吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0245_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_02_1000_otte", "source_sha256": "51229cd121eaa22649213cef283e072c69af9f3037f0070ebe0592e464a8322a", "ja": "いたぞ、ヴァンパイアだ！", "zh": "在那边，是吸血鬼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0245_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_02_1001_otte", "source_sha256": "c97116d457dc469b993c342d18d25f35f9af4cfc6a53d231f89496333c331604", "ja": "向こうに行ったぞ、逃がすな！", "zh": "往那边去了，别放跑了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0245_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_02_1002_038chz", "source_sha256": "828511f82e51ae76dc64458fc84c695e2cd950dff05f5b81dfb070b771c44e42", "ja": "ハァッ……ハァッ……。\nくそっ……早く逃げなければ……。", "zh": "哈啊……哈啊……。\n可恶……得赶紧逃走……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0245_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_02_1003_007ior", "source_sha256": "1e278ef5aed07fcc839ad43176457648e91af35ec9e049feec833459c0fdf47e", "ja": "大丈夫よ、お姉さま。\n心配しなくても、私が守ってあげるわ。", "zh": "没事的，姐姐大人。\n不用担心，我会保护你的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0245_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_02_1004_007ior", "source_sha256": "77a972b8658c9aa06aec125ae979c47dff0dc984771a22032a8eb6bd5fb9dfca", "ja": "だって私、とっても強いんだから。\nお姉さまにも見せてあげるわ。", "zh": "因为我可是非常强的。\n也让姐姐大人见识一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0245_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_02_1005_038chz", "source_sha256": "0f61cc8e74ef0c086649181b00bbafecdee666128b065a0a67e2761c20f855f7", "ja": "ノエル！\nダメだ、人を襲っては……！", "zh": "诺艾尔！\n不可以袭击人……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0245_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_02_1006_se", "source_sha256": "4ddae2b15490af7983897e7b8521f0ad2fd1d2dc36541cb859e6305538e2aa88", "ja": "ガサッ……", "zh": "沙沙……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0245_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_02_1007_046rio", "source_sha256": "369cd144a2d8dbd6c181753ed25937e5ffaedf8785dd6f3c7ff1b710b12dcc8f", "ja": "……ねえ。\n貴方達も、追われているの？", "zh": "……我说。\n你们也正在被追赶吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0245_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_02_1008_007ior", "source_sha256": "22063a368780f48eee112d306a61e97ea7a0d14934e1c8cb75f7128f1ac55d7e", "ja": "……。誰？　貴方。", "zh": "……你是谁？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0245_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_02_1009_se", "source_sha256": "cecacb4078a3174484be6e6336f36d7229bdaaa339fe9d97f30dae477d83c4c7", "ja": "タッタッタッ……", "zh": "哒哒哒……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0245_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_02_1010_otte", "source_sha256": "7c9a208752d4d5ffb9b8f10f40b0a2d1620ab0dc3c9badc2637a3c3150ac030a", "ja": "おかしいな。\nまだこの辺りにいるはずなんだが……。", "zh": "奇怪了。\n应该还在这附近才对……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0245_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_02_1011_046rio", "source_sha256": "7a6e2b0ecbb510e674344f60ffb35e610cf5144c668fbfd3a78019a734dd6617", "ja": "……ここは危険みたい。話は、後にしましょう。\n裏からなら、逃げられる。さぁ。", "zh": "……这里好像很危险。我们之后再说吧。\n从后面走的话，就能逃出去。来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0245_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_02_1012_038chz", "source_sha256": "318d24015ffb9ce6c6d8ea65848c72f6cb214b45e9f8519a381679494cc34108", "ja": "ま、待て！\n私に触れては……っ！？", "zh": "等等，住手！\n别碰我……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0245_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_02_1013_se", "source_sha256": "db0cad5fd344b3824b10ec7bc54fc7145b41513a49cde02ba23c3ff50785b48a", "ja": "グイッ", "zh": "用力一拉", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0245_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_02_1014_038chz", "source_sha256": "63b0a53cd81edf40031293fd128ba9d36729c27e83d913a1c83bcbf1dcfcab8a", "ja": "えっ……。", "zh": "咦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0245_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_02_1015_038chz", "source_sha256": "a6f09a63cf8090cc7ef9726f454423a79fd02b1f5e4c52c613f7827b9fd26223", "ja": "（この女性、どうして私に触れられるんだ！？\nそれに、辺境伯夫人……エレオノーラに似ている？）", "zh": "（这个女人，为什么能触碰到我！？而且，她和边境伯夫人埃莱奥诺拉很像？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0245_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_02_1016_038chz", "source_sha256": "9b5ba81e712e197d1e9c29fc1e07ac32b4f9c3817272dcd86430a6c76d3dc2f2", "ja": "（一体、どういう事なんだ……）", "zh": "（这到底是怎么回事……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0245_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_02_1017_038chz", "source_sha256": "3f2f24d5da152a2e17fae2674a205cd1b8b79e5cb75d7438e0e767550ede4cfd", "ja": "すまない、助かった。その……。", "zh": "抱歉，帮大忙了。那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0245_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_02_1018_046rio", "source_sha256": "81583f8828eb7e272551da4aeba936bebf218ae472292c3d21929228e37bab8c", "ja": "私の名前は、そうね。アンジェリカとでも\n名乗っておこうかしら。貴方達は？", "zh": "我的名字嘛，就叫安洁莉卡吧。你们呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0245_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_02_1019_038chz", "source_sha256": "28b90398000529748ac81685560ffbc1b8b436b3ae4bca6825742981e033e2e6", "ja": "……私はアレクシア。\nこっちは、妹のノーラだ。", "zh": "……我是亚历克西亚。\n这位是我的妹妹诺拉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0245_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_02_1020_046rio", "source_sha256": "a3eac997fdcefa55bb1e0d600fdcbf7520adf112251e171e2e75e7e196f1a483", "ja": "アレクシアとノーラね。\n単刀直入に聞くけど……。", "zh": "是亚历克西娅和诺拉啊。那我就直截了当地问了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0245_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_02_1021_046rio", "source_sha256": "08ce3e69dbd9652755d6046b89118b9903404e17f1a02b556f54e697cdd6aa4e", "ja": "貴方達、ヴァンパイアなんでしょう？", "zh": "你们是吸血鬼吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0245_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_02_1023_007ior", "source_sha256": "6482584c6c890c36c2516ba4fc47d0551a6c7f78aab7510278f65aea51269255", "ja": "……やっぱり。\n貴方もそうなんでしょ？", "zh": "……果然。\n你也是那样的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0245_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_02_1024_046rio", "source_sha256": "cf2266b9d2a9fb2bb29c04e4d3440ca69825602fea89ba25ae1b0f8d1165836f", "ja": "ええ。でも、正確にはヴァンパイアではなく\nダンピール。ヴァンパイアと人間の間に生まれた者よ。", "zh": "是的。不过，严格来说并不是吸血鬼，而是半吸血鬼。是吸血鬼与人类所生的孩子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0245_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_02_1025_038chz", "source_sha256": "d73bd24bd1e2cf0176d944e90719a8335e7672e44c46e7cd29608048b1a13948", "ja": "ダンピール……。", "zh": "丹皮尔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0245_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_02_1026_046rio", "source_sha256": "8296496a0d4914dec2c414e305d444094cf3552222f9ae795d2da487a5b67c44", "ja": "ええ。\nどうやら貴方もそうみたいね、アレクシア。", "zh": "嗯。\n看来你也是呢，阿莱克西亚。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0245_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_02_1027_038chz", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0245_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_02_1029_046rio", "source_sha256": "29cfb80daf86c60be5c59e40eabcad1349fccb9950073bb357a93f5b356272cf", "ja": "ダンピールは、吸血鬼に出会うとすぐに\n『わかる』のよ。それに……。", "zh": "半吸血鬼一遇到吸血鬼，就会立刻“知道”的。而且……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0245_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_02_1030_046rio", "source_sha256": "3b4b40a345dca9b9fd57f55e679ccd1ff4bc236be86719708144a37cebb34915", "ja": "貴方、人間には触れなかったのではなくて？\n動物以外、誰にも……。", "zh": "您之前没碰过人类吧？\n除了动物以外……谁都没有……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0245_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_02_1031_038chz", "source_sha256": "6336184c670a24fe6f525019d0bc519df2a0c73b418456ba895498a56f86554c", "ja": "！？　ど、どうしてそれを……！", "zh": "！？为、为什么你会知道……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0245_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_02_1032_046rio", "source_sha256": "956a4437fdeed21564b9ef1244ca46305a0fc8a02bd8cf64ad613fe905ebdca3", "ja": "仕方ないでしょ。私達は、闇の生き物。\n生まれながらにして、人間ではないんだから。", "zh": "没办法啊。我们是黑暗中的生物。\n从出生起，就不是人类。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0245_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_02_1033_046rio", "source_sha256": "f02ff839633789761c5f93777959f0d06f2a1370b704aa187530c4fe549055c1", "ja": "人間は、闇に触れる事はできない。闇に触れる事が\nできるのは、動物のように純粋なものだけ……。", "zh": "人类无法触碰黑暗。能够触碰黑暗的，只有像动物一样纯粹的存在……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0245_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_02_1034_038chz", "source_sha256": "4513f29b4845c1259d4f6f85dd6b144bb6d0649478023199169152ed6bb60aa3", "ja": "動物のように……純粋なもの……。", "zh": "如动物一般……纯粹的存在……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0245_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_02_1036_038chz", "source_sha256": "f75a8be73f6a4461b9145040888dd93a367a00fc6c837bcc9551658cde99bb4c", "ja": "そんな……。\n私が、ダンピール……？", "zh": "怎么会……  \n我竟然是半吸血鬼……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0245_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_02_1037_020meg", "source_sha256": "cafb5dbb55ac10e54e28c5c6b3178cd79a31e3537463f8a982beb7c16f0abf4d", "ja": "……え～！！？", "zh": "……诶～！！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0245_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_02_1038_020meg", "source_sha256": "307b252f33c27234bdab0cb127ad469723d3781e1b8462ae26af44897725fcd0", "ja": "今度こそ幸せになろうねって誓ったばっかなのに……\nこの仕打ちは何！？　{$P$}！", "zh": "我们明明才刚发誓这次一定要幸福的……  \n这种对待是怎么回事！？{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0245_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_02_1039_031tom", "source_sha256": "cbdd6920878def4ebc2355186f2eb1a1222f6b2c9ece8f9c979882f43170ef31", "ja": "たしかに、ひどい話ですね～。\n{$P$}さん、どういうことですか～？", "zh": "确实，真是太过分了～  \n{$P$}先生，这是怎么回事呀～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0245_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_02_1040_038chz", "source_sha256": "5e4d83d086b6b999e6ba312e12bee2afa5a44255a122fef3fe016c83bc35524b", "ja": "アレクサンドラも気の毒ですわ。ノエルを人に戻す\n方法は見つからず、その上今度は自身まで……。", "zh": "亚历山德拉也真是可怜。没能找到让诺艾尔变回人类的方法，结果这次连自己也……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0245_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_02_1041_046rio", "source_sha256": "f0a693bccb04497224b8c21e13306219902e2e8a4c191e7be64356edd8de669b", "ja": "そうよそうよ！　{$P$}くん、\nせっかくの続編がこんな暗いお話でいいわけ？", "zh": "没错没错！{$P$}，难得的续篇，怎么能是这么阴暗的故事呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0245_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_02_1042_p", "source_sha256": "7f8e836474255821759ca6e55dfc4dfee44ac29c6522354beef33e145553284c", "ja": "俺に言われても……。", "zh": "就算你这么说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0245_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_02_1043_020meg", "source_sha256": "5e5e4fb915f634b5d1becfd0e8a360173ed4b2e708fde3ea70e8c266ab011441", "ja": "無責任すぎるよ！　責任取って！！\n鬼！　悪魔！　{$P$}！", "zh": "太不负责任了！　你要负责！！\n鬼！　恶魔！　{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0245_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_02_1044_046rio", "source_sha256": "b29676ddac4711d132828b211264c56800b2623a73e077842bc5b4694a284bb6", "ja": "泣かないで、恵美ちゃん。こうなったら私たち自身で、\nみんなを幸せにしてあげるしかないわ！", "zh": "别哭了，惠美。事到如今，我们只能亲自让大家幸福了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0245_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_02_1045_038chz", "source_sha256": "9eb92c7301f982e32defec1842c852bef7e42facb55c91414d9b06c3a7985dc8", "ja": "私たちでって……\nどうするつもりですの？　莉緒さん。", "zh": "我们自己来……\n您打算怎么做呢？莉緒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0245_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_02_1046_046rio", "source_sha256": "d20ab252f9ea8f530f9597e97d3da023547f9cb89a1e49d0b7b31e049f1296f1", "ja": "もちろん、私たちでお話を考えるのよ！\nそうね、たとえば～……。", "zh": "当然是由我们来构思故事啦！\n嗯，比如说～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
